      "title": "HDFCBANK: Governance Actions And Dividends Will Support Future Share Price Rebound",
      "body": "Analysts have slightly trimmed their fair value estimate for HDFC Bank, with the price target moving marginally lower from about ₹1,041.89 to ₹1,041.08, reflecting updated assumptions on the discount rate, revenue growth, profit margins and future P/E. What's in the News Board meeting on March 26, 2026 to consider re appointing Dr. Sunita Maheshwari as an independent director for a three year term from March 30, 2026 to March 29, 2029, subject to shareholder approval (Board Meeting).",
      "keyDevTypeId": null,
