      "body": "Analysts have trimmed their price target on HDFC Bank from ₹1,137.03 to ₹1,105.71, citing slightly softer assumptions around future P/E, revenue growth and profit margins, while keeping the discount rate broadly similar. What's in the News Board meeting on Feb 3, 2026 to consider the reappointment of Mr. Kaizad Bharucha as Deputy Managing Director for three years from Apr 19, 2026 to Apr 18, 2029, subject to approvals (company filing).",
