      "title": "HDFC Bank Limited: Navigating the \"HDFC 2.0\" Integration Era",
      "body": "HDFC Bank (HDFCBANK) , India's largest private sector lender and a global systemic powerhouse, closed the April 6, 2026, trading session at ₹771.20 on the National Stock Exchange (NSE). Following its 2023 mega-merger with HDFC Ltd, the bank has spent the last two years digesting a massive mortgage book and restructuring its liabilities.",
